        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CF-956, Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe think that the Crossed Indian Drum Cabinet Cup Pull has a certain colonial charm that is so stunning. The ribbon and reed design is iconic of traditional decor, a true classic. This cup pull handle made by RK International is available in 6 finishes: antique english, oil rubbed bronze, distressed copper, satin nickel, polished nickel and distressed nickel. It has a 3 inch center to center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching:<a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-853\"><b>Matching Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/crossed-indian-drum-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-757\"><b>Matching Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CF-956 Crossed Indian Drum Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
